The magnetic force on the length \(𝑙\) of either wire is given by;
\(F =\frac{\mu_{0}I_{1}I_{2}l}{2\pi d}\)
The original force between the wires is given by;
\(F= \frac{\mu_{0}I_{0}^{2}l}{2\pi d}~~~...(1)\)
The new force between the wires is given by;
\(F' = \frac{\mu_{0}\times 4I_{0}^{2}l}{2\pi\left({{{d}\over{2}}}\right)} =
\frac{8\mu_{0}I_{0}^{2}l}{2\pi d}~~~...(2)\)
From the equation \((1)\) and \((2)\) we get;
\(F'=8F\)
